OL,3,GNEWSATime capsule celebrates 100 years
OL,4,Aof Winnie-the-Pooh
OL,5,
OL,6,FNeil Reed, one of the tea room's
OL,7,Fowners, told BBC Radio Sussex: "The
OL,8,Fstrange thing about it is you couldn't
OL,9,Fsay 'draw me a Winnie-the-Pooh fan',
OL,10,Fit's everybody."
